WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:05.038
- HELLO? THANKS FOR CALLING
MARIO'S PIZZA.

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:06.806
THIS IS CARLOS SPEAKING.

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:08.108
- HELLO.

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:11.945
WE WOULD LIKE A LARGE PIE

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:15.615
WITH PEPPERONI, PINEAPPLE,
AND CHEESY CRUST.

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:18.985
- LARGE PEPPERONI
WITH PINEAPPLE AND CHEESY CRUST.

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:22.989
- WE WOULD ALSO LIKE
A LARGE PIE

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.924
WITH BACON, PINEAPPLE,

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.160
AND...CHEESY CRUST.

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:29.396
- LARGE BACON, PINEAPPLE,
WITH CHEESY CRUST. OKAY.

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:31.264
IS THAT GONNA COMPLETE
YOUR ORDER, SIR?

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:33.166
- YOU KNOW WHAT?
LET ME GAUGE THE ROOM.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:35.268
UH, GUYS, ARE WE GONNA WANT
ANOTHER PIZZA?

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:37.003
LET ME JUST--WHO'S HUNGRY?
SHOW OF HANDS.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:38.705
LET ME SEE 'EM.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:41.241
ONE, TWO, THREE.
KEEP 'EM UP.

00:00:41.408 --> 00:00:43.343
FOUR, FIVE, SIX.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:45.111
- AH, HAVING A PARTY.
[chuckling]

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:46.746
- YUP.
PRETTY BIG ONE TOO.

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:48.415
COME ON, GUYS,
KEEP 'EM UP.

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:50.483
HUGO, SUMMER?
HANDS? FOOD?

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.419
YOU KNOW WHAT,
LET'S PLAY IT SAFE.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:55.355
LET'S GET ANOTHER PIE
WITH HAM, PINEAPPLE.

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:57.490
- ALL RIGHT, HAM--

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:59.325
OH, ARE YOU GUYS GONNA NEED
CHEESY CRUST ON THE THIRD?

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:01.361
- GOOD QUESTION.
I'LL GAUGE THE ROOM.

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:04.264
HEY, GUYS, DO WE WANT
CHEESY CRUST ON THE THIRD?

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:05.932
OKAY, YEESH.

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:08.701
THAT IS A RESOUNDING YES

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.937
FOR CHEESY CRUST
ON THE THIRD.

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:13.640
CLAIRE SAYS YOU READ HER MIND.

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:15.175
- CLAIRE, HUH?
I LIKE THAT NAME.

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.077
- IT'S A GOOD ONE.

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:20.380
OH, ALSO, MY BOY ANDY OVER HERE
IS SAYING

00:01:20.547 --> 00:01:22.382
YOU HAVE SOMETHING
CALLED CHICKEN POPPERS.

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:23.716
- IS SHE CUTE?

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.418
- UH, WHO'S THAT AND WHAT NOW?

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:28.354
- CLAIRE.
- OH.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:32.125
HER BODY'S LIKE A FOUR.
ANYWAY, WE WOULD ALSO--

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:36.029
- WELL, H-HOW DO YOU MEAN?

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:39.099
- HA, LET'S JUST SAY
SHE'S KIND OF A BIG GIRL.

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:41.301
- THAT'S ALL GOOD.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.436
THAT'S ALL SUPERFICIAL, MAN.
I LIKE CLAIRE FOR WHAT'S INSIDE.

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:44.838
- YOU DON'T EVEN KNOW CLAIRE.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.606
- YO, BUT FOR REAL THOUGH,

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.341
I FEEL LIKE
I DO KNOW CLAIRE, MAN.

00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:51.177
PUT ME ON THE PHONE
WITH HER.

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:55.748
- UH...YOU DON'T NEED
TO SPEAK TO CLAIRE.

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:59.986
- NO, I DO.

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:03.089
YOU KNOW WHAT,
I GOTTA LEVEL WITH YOU, MAN.

00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:05.959
I...[bleep] HER.

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:08.061
- OH! OH, I'M SORRY.

00:02:08.228 --> 00:02:10.730
I DIDN'T MEAN TO GET
IN BETWEEN YOU GUYS.

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:14.400
- NO, IT'S QUITE ALL RIGHT.

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:16.069
'TWAS A WHILE AGO...

00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:19.439
BEFORE SHE BLIMPED UP.

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:21.641
MY CURRENT GIRLFRIEND'S LIV.

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:27.313
BODY, TEN.
FACE, TEN.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:32.152
BUT ANYWAY, CLAIRE--YEAH.
I HIT THAT SEXUALLY.

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:34.854
AND, UH, AS DID MY BOY HUGO.

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:37.790
HELL, EVEN BUBBA GOT
SOME OF THAT.

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:41.394
SO JUST WANTED YOU TO KNOW,
USED GOODS, USED GOODS.

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:43.196
- SO YOU WOULDN'T CARE
IF I ASKED HER OUT?

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:47.300
- WELL...
LET ME DO IT FOR YOU.

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:49.002
HEY, CLAIRE, THIS GUY
FROM THE PIZZA PLACE

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:50.770
WANTS TO DATE YOU.
TOO POOR?

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:52.572
ALL RIGHT,
I'LL LET HIM DOWN EASY.

00:02:52.739 --> 00:02:55.308
- WAIT, WAIT, WAIT, WAIT, WAIT.
NO.

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:58.611
TELL HER THAT, NO,
I'M NOT A RICH MAN.

00:02:58.778 --> 00:03:01.281
BUT I'M A GOOD MAN.

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:04.217
TELL HER,
"CLAIRE, I BELIEVE IN DESTINY.

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:06.886
"AND I BELIEVE
THAT WE'VE ALWAYS KNOWN

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:08.888
"THAT OUR SOUL MATE
WAS OUT THERE.

00:03:09.055 --> 00:03:11.925
"THE MOMENT THAT WE HAD
THAT UNSPOKEN CONNECTION

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:14.294
"ABOUT THE CHEESY CRUST...

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:17.830
"I REALIZED THAT YOU WERE
ALWAYS THE ONE.

00:03:17.997 --> 00:03:21.434
"BECAUSE--AND I KNOW
THIS SOUNDS CORNY--

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:24.437
"BUT THAT MOMENT...

00:03:24.604 --> 00:03:27.774
"WAS JUST LIKE...

00:03:27.941 --> 00:03:29.776
SIMPLE."

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:36.883
- WOW.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:38.484
YOU REALLY DO CARE
ABOUT CLAIRE.

00:03:38.651 --> 00:03:43.256
- I DO.

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:45.024
- OH, MY GOD!
CLAIRE JUST GOT SHOT!

00:03:45.191 --> 00:03:46.893
- WHAT?
NO!

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.761
- OH! IT JUST CAME
THROUGH THE WINDOW.

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:50.496
IT WAS A BULLET.
IT HIT HER IN THE NECK.

00:03:50.663 --> 00:03:52.298
OH, CLAIRE'S DOWN!
SHE'S DEAD!

00:03:52.465 --> 00:03:53.366
SHE'S DEAD!
I'M CALLING THE COPS!

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:54.400
SHE'S DEAD!

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:55.335
- CLAIRE!

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:57.837
NOOOO!

00:04:03.009 --> 00:04:04.410
- CHINESE IT IS.

